<title>SPAIN: Spain employment outpaces economic growth - ministry.</title>
<headline>Spain employment outpaces economic growth - ministry.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish employment growth is outpacing economic growth, the economy ministry said in a statement on Thursday commenting on the latest unemployment data.</p>
<p>A survey, released earlier, showed the number of unemployed fell by 18,340 in September while the rate fell to 21.80 percent in September from 21.92 in August.</p>
<p>The ministry noted a trend of &quot;high and rising rates of new employment.&quot;</p>
<p>Employment rising at a 3.3 percent rate is outpacing economic growth, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
